      "Waveform features:",
      "From $-\\infty$ to $0$: flat line at $y(t) = 0$.",
      "From $0$ to $1$: positive half-cycle of the sine wave (since $1 \\cdot (+x_2) = +x_2$).",
      "From $1$ to $2$: positive half-cycle of the sine wave! Since $x_2(t) < 0$ on $(1, 2)$, multiplying by $-1$ reflects the negative lobe across the time axis, resulting in full-wave rectification on $[0, 2]$.",
      "From $2$ to $3$: flat line at $y(t) = 0$ (since $x_1(t) = 0$).",
      "For $t > 3$: follows $x_2(t)$, dipping below the axis into a negative half-cycle."
