     "t": "math",
     "tex": "y(t) = \\begin{cases}\n0, & t \\le 0 \\\\\n\\sin(\\pi t), & 0 < t < 1 \\quad (\\text{positive arch}) \\\\\n-\\sin(\\pi t) = |\\sin(\\pi t)|, & 1 < t < 2 \\quad (\\text{rectified positive arch}) \\\\\n0, & 2 \\le t \\le 3 \\\\\n\\sin(\\pi t), & t > 3 \\quad (\\text{negative arch for } 3 < t < 4)\n\\end{cases}"
