     "t": "math",
     "tex": "\\delta(-2\\tau + 3) = \\delta\\left[-2\\left(\\tau - \\frac{3}{2}\\right)\\right] = \\frac{1}{2} \\delta\\left(\\tau - \\frac{3}{2}\\right)"
